11:By decree of King Protor, the second ruler of Valtaria, entry to the city of Anter is forbidden.
12:Entry is prohibited. Enter at your own risk!!!
13:DO NOT ENTER!!!
14:I saw someone there. Flee while you can!!!
15:Mom?!?
16:Siege machines wreaked destruction. This city is proof of that. For your own good, do not enter the city of Anter.
17:Farewell, friends.
18:Go away!!!
19:Doom is NEAR!!!
20:TURN BACK, MORTALS!!!
21:Travelers through the Wasteland of Souls. May the goddess protect you.
22:Forgive us, goddess Immo.
23:Please, Truth, give us strength. 
24:Desolation of Souls: Travelers are advised to travel faster.
25:Desolation of Souls
