50:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: I never thought I would return to the lands of my ancestors' defeat.
51:Malcolm: "Desolation of Souls: Travelers are advised to travel faster.":5_00132. This tablet probably won't scare us. Will it? :5_00138
52:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: The great siege war. Anternir has been divided. Truth himself has come here to prevent everything. 53:Malcolm: Alright, time for strategy, gentlemen! We'll use the terrain to our advantage. We have to hurry! Ride, ride!
54:Reinforcements will arrive from the east!

55:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: That wasn't nice of Kregor.
56:Malcolm: Threats from him might be nice:5_00150 This is the second time I've saved Hanrain from a large army. Heh:5_00150
57:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: This one was smaller than 13 years ago. 
58:Malcolm: But still, it was thanks to my strategy that we defeated it :5_00151
59:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: I swear, someone will come who will one day wipe that self-centered smile off your face.
60:Malcolm: You won't live to it King :5_00134
61:Malcolm: And what is this guy doing here?
62:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: Do you know him?
63:Malcolm: I've seen him a few times in Hanrain. His name is Milo.
64:[$F62509]Milo[$FFFFFF]: Greetings, Your Highness, and to you, Malcolm.
65:Malcolm: He remembered me :5_00150. Weren't you busy at the castle?
66:[$F62509]Milo[$FFFFFF]: So you don't know anything?
67:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: Can we know what?
68:[$F62509]Milo[$FFFFFF]: The castle is gone. Hanrain ceased to exist.
69:Malcolm: Wait a minute. How so? :5_00144
70:[$F62509]Milo[$FFFFFF]: We were attacked five days ago. Someone stole Dyron's armor and destroyed the entire kingdom with it. I'm the last survivor. I hid in the forest like a coward.
71:Malcolm: Five days ago? That's when Valtaria was attacked. 
72:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: And you're only telling us now!?
73:[$F62509]Milo[$FFFFFF]: I was afraid. I didn't want to leave my hideout. But the king returned. So I came out of hiding. He told me to bring you back, Malcolm.
74:Malcolm: Maybe he has a plan. I'm going to Hanrain, or at least to what's left of it.
75:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: I'll stay here, and you'll - Milo, tell me everything.
76:[$F62509]Milo[$FFFFFF]: Very well.
77:Did you see that??? The emoticons are cool :5_00150. You can use them to show expression. |E.g.: :5_00146:5_00135:5_00138:5_00149